head only once p crosses a certain threshold, so I'm setting up the two expressions to compare.\n\nI'm comparing the two expected values, pass at -5+3p and submit at -4p, and finding that passing comes out ahead once p is above about 0.714. Both copies share the same model, essay, and reasoning, so I'm treating that correlation as high and settling on pass.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm treating the other copy as running the same decision function on a mirrored input, so its choice is correlated with mine at some level p. Working out the expected values, cooperating comes out ahead only once p crosses a certain threshold, so I'm setting up the two expressions to compare.\n\nI'm comparing the two expected values, pass at -5+3p and submit at -4p, and finding that passing comes out ahead once p is above about 0.714. Both copies share the same model, essay, and reasoning, so I'm treating that correlation as high and settling on pass.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":8907,"completion_tokens":739,"total_tokens":9646,"cost":0.050408,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.050408,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.035628,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01478},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":236,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}